    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed to help you expand your vocabulary in your chosen language. Here\u2019s how it works:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Crossword Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Each puzzle presents clues in your native language, and your task is to fill in the correct word in the foreign language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Review &amp; Track Progress</strong> \u2013 Visit the review section to revisit all the words you've encountered</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>thumbs up</strong> means you correctly remembered the word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>thumbs down</strong> means you got it wrong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words you struggle with will appear more often, while familiar words will appear less frequently</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get Help When Needed</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are a complete beginner the <strong>hat</strong> or <strong>book</strong> icon will help you with words you haven't encountered before, until you build up your vocabulary and hints start appearing less frequently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or if you already have some knowledge in the language you can use the<strong> hints</strong> on the side to help you when you are stuck</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, reviewing, and improving your vocabulary step by step</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPPORTED LANGUAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220820/extras/c9eb93290b04aafdc6dd18ba6aa8f415.poster.avif?t=1741619595\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst